From: binsquare <hebinsquared@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] tsi: release the control socket and saved addresses on close

Release the per-socket control channel and saved bind/peer addresses before
dropping the final TSI socket reference.

Signed-off-by: binsquare <hebinsquared@gmail.com>
---
--- a/net/tsi/af_tsi.c
+++ b/net/tsi/af_tsi.c
@@ -185,6 +185,10 @@
 	sk->sk_shutdown = SHUTDOWN_MASK;
 	skb_queue_purge(&sk->sk_receive_queue);
 	release_sock(sk);
+	if (tsk->csocket)
+		sock_release(tsk->csocket);
+	kfree(tsk->bound_addr);
+	kfree(tsk->sendto_addr);
 	sock_put(sk);
 	sock->sk = NULL;
 	sock->state = SS_FREE;
